{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21262","headline":"玉泉道中作 · 元稹","name":"玉泉道中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚俗物候晚，孟冬才有霜。\n早农半华实，夕水含风凉。\n遐想云外寺，峰峦渺相望。\n松门接官路，泉脉连僧房。\n微露上弦月，暗焚初夜香。\n谷深烟壒净，山虚钟磬长。\n念此清境远，复忧尘事妨。\n行行即前路，勿滞分寸光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21262.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21262","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}